      "explanation": "Main idea: die Auflage means the circulation or edition of a book, newspaper or magazine, and in official texts also a condition. In the media, Auflage is often the number of copies. For books, it can be the number of the edition. In contracts or permits, Auflage means a requirement or condition.",
