      "explanation": "Main idea: behalten means to keep something for yourself or to keep something in mind. behalten means to keep something in your possession or with you. It can also mean to keep in mind, that is, to remember. With objects, behalten is usually translated as keep. With information, a name or a number, it often means to remember. The phrase im Kopf behalten means to keep in your head.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Du kannst das Buch behalten.",
          "lv": "You can keep the book."
        },
        {
          "de": "Ich möchte den Schlüssel behalten.",
          "lv": "I want to keep the key."
        },
        {
          "de": "Behalten Sie den Rest.",
          "lv": "Keep the change."
        },
        {
          "de": "Ich kann mir die Nummer nicht behalten.",
          "lv": "I cannot remember the number."
        },
        {
          "de": "Behalte das bitte im Kopf.",
          "lv": "Please keep that in mind."
        },
        {
          "de": "Sie hat seinen Namen behalten.",
          "lv": "She remembered his name."
        }
      ],
      "comparison": [
        {
          "word": "behalten",
          "meaning": "to keep / remember",
          "example": "Du kannst es behalten. = You can keep it."
        },
        {
          "word": "halten",
          "meaning": "to hold",
          "example": "Ich halte die Tasche. = I am holding the bag."
        },
        {
          "word": "sich merken",
          "meaning": "to memorise / remember",
          "example": "Ich merke mir die Nummer. = I am memorising the number."
        },
        {
          "word": "erinnern",
          "meaning": "to remember / remind",
          "example": "Ich erinnere mich daran. = I remember it."
        },
        {
          "word": "aufbewahren",
          "meaning": "to store",
          "example": "Ich bewahre die Quittung auf. = I am keeping the receipt."
        }
      ],
      "tip": {
        "leftBlocks": [
          {
            "text": "With things, behalten usually means to keep."
          },
          {
            "text": "With names, numbers and information, behalten often means to remember or keep in mind."
          }
        ]
      },
      "important": {
        "text": "behalten is not simply halten.",
        "example": "halten = to hold. behalten = to keep. sich merken = to memorise. im Kopf behalten = to keep in mind."
      },
