      "layout": "standardStudy",
      "translation": "Remedy",
      "explanation": [
        "Main idea: das Mittel most often means a means or remedy by which something is achieved or solved.",
        "It can be a practical product, for example a cleaning product or medicine.",
        "In the plural, Mittel can also mean money or material resources.",
        "In mathematics or statistics Mittel can mean the average, but at A2 level the main meaning is remedy or means.",
        "Context shows whether it is about a thing, money or a method."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Das ist ein gutes Mittel gegen Husten.",
          "lv": "That is a good remedy for a cough."
        },
        {
          "de": "Wir brauchen ein Mittel gegen Flecken.",
          "lv": "We need a stain remover."
        },
        {
          "de": "Die Firma hat nicht genug Mittel.",
          "lv": "The company does not have enough funds."
        },
        {
          "de": "Sport ist ein gutes Mittel gegen Stress.",
          "lv": "Sport is a good remedy for stress."
        },
        {
          "de": "Dieses Mittel hilft schnell.",
          "lv": "This remedy works quickly."
        }
      ],
      "comparison": [
        {
          "word": "das Mittel",
          "meaning": "remedy / means",
          "example": "ein Mittel gegen Husten = ein Mittel gegen Husten = a cough remedy"
        },
        {
          "word": "das Medikament",
          "meaning": "medicine / drug",
          "example": "Das Medikament hilft. = The medicine helps."
        },
        {
          "word": "die Methode",
          "meaning": "method",
          "example": "Diese Methode ist einfach. = This method is simple."
        },
        {
          "word": "das Geld",
          "meaning": "money",
          "example": "Wir haben kein Geld. = We have no money."
        },
        {
          "word": "die Mittel",
          "meaning": "funds / resources",
          "example": "finanzielle Mittel = finanzielle Mittel = financial resources"
        }
      ],
      "tip": [
        "If something helps to solve a problem, German often uses das Mittel.",
        "If it is about a specific medicine, Medikament is used more often."
      ],
      "important": [
        "das Mittel is not the same as die Mitte.",
        "Mittel = remedy, means; Mitte = middle."
      ],
